<li id="S4.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I4.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I4.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Note: Based on 155,424 sampled LLM service invocations.</span></p>
